Many thanks to Chuck Taylor, Brad Biggerstaff, and Jim Handsfield who
pointed out the solution to overlapping, offset windows at startup:

Manually arrange the windows the way you like them, then select Options
| Save Window Size/Properties as default from the menu bar.

You do need to do this separately for each window you have set to open.
