       tr  3  0.578209 0.1927363  4.65815 0.01015794
   tr: c1  1  0.460769 0.4607686 11.13608 0.00265046
Residuals 25  1.034405 0.0413762                    

The SS and F ratio for the factor tr are ok but the SS and F ratio
corresponding au first contrast should be:

0.4561725 and 11.025 (see below)

I'll post a summary for this query (and for the previous questions
as well when they will be solved). Thank you for your help.

Gabriel Baud-Bovy

data<-data.frame(tr=rep(1:4,c(7,8,6,8)),
        weight=c(3.52,3.36,3.57,4.19,3.88,3.76,3.94,
