contrast.test(aov.obj,"x",data,type="marginal.means")
           SS  Estimates StdError          t resid.df          P 
.L 2561.52381  19.327585 8.266302  2.3381174       11 0.03930256
.Q   66.78261  -3.265986 8.650985 -0.3775277       11 0.71296427

# very close to SPSS but StdError is slightly different in SPSS:
contrast.test(aov.obj,"x",data,type="adj.means")
           SS  Estimates StdError         t resid.df          P 
.L 2248.89947  18.109790 8.266302  2.190797       11 0.05089739
.Q   98.63124  -3.969081 8.650985 -0.458801       11 0.65530963

